  "text_md": "# Rustfri fjederdampere\n\n# FDA-316\n\n# Produktbeskrivelse\n\nKonstrueret for vibrationsisolering af maskiner med et omdrejningstal pẳ mere end 450 O/min.\n\nKan belastes fra 12-125k9.\n\n# Komponenter\n\nRustfri StẴlfjeder FDA 25-75 AISI 316L, 850t salttẵge FDA 100-125 AISI 302, 650t salttẵge\n\n- 2 og bund kappe AISI 316L Top\n- 3 Bund skrue AISI 316L\n\n\nFodplade AISI 316L\n\n5 EVA gummi, pẵklvbet\n\n# Anvendelse\n\nlet i agressive miljper: generatorer; kompresso rer;\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th>Type</th>\n    <th>Maks Belastning [kg]</th>\n    <th>Nedbejning [mm]</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>FDA025-316</td>\n    <td>25</td>\n    <td>24</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>FDA025-316B1</td>\n    <td>25</td>\n    <td>24</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>FDA025-316B2</td>\n    <td>25</td>\n    <td>24</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>FDAO5O-316</td>\n    <td>50</td>\n    <td>24</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>FDA05O-316B1</td>\n    <td>50</td>\n    <td>24</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>FDA05O-316B2</td>\n    <td>50</td>\n    <td>24</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>FDA075-316</td>\n    <td>75</td>\n    <td>24</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td> </td>\n    <td>75</td>\n    <td>24</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>FDA075-316B2</td>\n    <td>75</td>\n    <td>24</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>FDA100-316</td>\n    <td>100</td>\n    <td>24</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>FDA100-31681</td>\n    <td>100</td>\n    <td>24</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td> </td>\n    <td>100</td>\n    <td>24</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>FDA125-316</td>\n    <td>125</td>\n    <td>24</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>FDA125-316B1</td>\n    <td>125</td>\n    <td>24</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>FDA125-316B2</td>\n    <td>125</td>\n    <td>24</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n\n![](<0486cc2ec11e21b6a8280ca71073ca28ea3f_pg1_images/imageFile1.png>)\n\n055\n\nM8\n\nTYPE FDA-316\n\nTYPE FDA-316B1\n\n![](<0486cc2ec11e21b6a8280ca71073ca28ea3f_pg1_images/imageFile2.png>)\n\nTYPE FDA-316B2\n\n![](<0486cc2ec11e21b6a828